  "description": "Choi Taeshik lives a quiet, normal life. He works hard at the office, takes good care of his body, occasionally goes on dates, and tries his best to be a responsible adult. One day two sisters down on their luck show up outside his work and ask for a place to live. Even though he finds out they are old family friends, how can Taeshik live with two girls? Just the thought makes him uncomfortable. After originally agreeing to let them stay for just one night, one of the sisters tempts Taeshik with a mutually beneficial offer he just can’t refuse! Will Taeshik be able to successfully navigate the sudden addition of two tantalizing roommates?\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
